{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Regime demands compliance and only the Remanent is left to stand in its way. Area Zero follows the development of Violet as she joins the Remanent in rebellion against the Union, a nation state under the control of the Regime. Choose your fighter and compete against a growing cast of characters.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In depth tutorial will show you the basics and how to use the hold-to-cancel input system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Develop your skills against computer-controlled opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your abilities by completing the combo trials for each character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge your friends with local versus mode</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3796060?t=1750610343","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796060/2b137c48991c6d4f1afa67935a9776b7a7fc6359/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750610343","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796060/78467ba77a24b26daf9dfc1caabe0b31d986131e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750610343","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796060/78467ba77a24b26daf9dfc1caabe0b31d986131e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750610343","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_para